Dialogue: 3,0:00:56.86,0:00:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachikuji!
Dialogue: 3,0:00:58.28,0:01:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:01.23,0:01:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so damn cute!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:04.25,0:01:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me touch you! Let me hug you!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:07.63,0:01:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I'm gonna see your panties!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:14.76,0:01:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oww!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:15.81,0:01:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:23.19,0:01:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm not an enemy!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:26.64,0:01:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down! Take a deep breath!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:34.70,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You breathe like a Terminator.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:38.83,0:01:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me! Me! Take a good look!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:46.37,0:01:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Muraragi-san.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:48.25,0:01:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call people things that sound so unsatisfying.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:51.38,0:01:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I stuttered.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:53.13,0:01:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you did it on purpose.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:54.87,0:01:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I bit my tongue!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:55.81,0:01:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't on purpose?!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:57.09,0:01:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,God is with us.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:58.47,0:02:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What miracle happened to you?!
Dialogue: 3,0:02:04.97,0:02:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've been studying for your exams?
Dialogue: 3,0:02:07.94,0:02:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can get help from the valedictorian and the 7th-best.
Dialogue: 3,0:02:11.55,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm invincible.
Dialogue: 3,0:02:13.88,0:02:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa-san's the one with braids that I met, right?
Dialogue: 3,0:02:19.57,0:02:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 3,0:02:20.70,0:02:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And Senjougahara-san's your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 3,0:02:24.99,0:02:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 3,0:02:27.50,0:02:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 3,0:02:30.21,0:02:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd go for Hanekawa-san between the two of them.
Dialogue: 3,0:02:35.50,0:02:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems kind of weird that you'd pick Senjougahara-san.
Dialogue: 3,0:02:39.72,0:02:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why I'd...
Dialogue: 3,0:02:43.72,0:02:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think of Hanekawa like that.
Dialogue: 3,0:02:47.81,0:02:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe her too much, and she'd probably shoot me down anyway.
Dialogue: 3,0:02:53.31,0:02:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus I'm into Senjougahara, despite her personality.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:02.80,0:03:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you say you prefer Senjougahara-san,
Dialogue: 3,0:03:06.81,0:03:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's right. It takes all kinds.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:12.78,0:03:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's "everyone has a type", isn't it?
Dialogue: 3,0:03:15.25,0:03:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:17.62,0:03:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,About that vampire.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:19.43,0:03:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... She's going by Oshino Shinobu-san now, right?
Dialogue: 3,0:03:24.18,0:03:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks about eight, blonde, with a helmet and goggles?
Dialogue: 3,0:03:29.87,0:03:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What about her?
Dialogue: 3,0:03:32.06,0:03:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to get close so I can't be sure,
Dialogue: 3,0:03:36.57,0:03:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think I saw her around yesterday.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:41.57,0:03:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,At around five at night,
Dialogue: 3,0:03:43.16,0:03:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,at the donut shop by the highway.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:48.54,0:03:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Donuts, huh.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:50.66,0:03:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Would Oshino really let her go out alone like that?
Dialogue: 3,0:03:55.00,0:03:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I thought the same thing.
Dialogue: 3,0:03:57.32,0:04:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I should tell you, so I waited for you here.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:02.22,0:04:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Why didn't you say so sooner?
Dialogue: 3,0:04:05.01,0:04:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:06.79,0:04:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Some pedo came up to me and started groping me.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:09.39,0:04:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so shocked that I forgot all about it.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:11.64,0:04:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Sorry I gave you the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:15.99,0:04:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad I could help you out.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:18.88,0:04:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, do you have the time?
Dialogue: 3,0:04:20.99,0:04:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:23.86,0:04:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, Hachikuji.
Dialogue: 3,0:04:26.12,0:04:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. I know we'll meet again.
Dialogue: 3,0:06:47.76,0:06:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 3,0:06:57.89,0:07:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 3,0:07:02.21,0:07:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not far.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:03.66,0:07:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 3,0:07:05.37,0:07:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Volunteering.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:10.77,0:07:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:12.15,0:07:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. Go ahead, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:15.05,0:07:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take pity on you and answer roll call for you.{there's a sex pun here}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:19.37,0:07:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it for me?
Dialogue: 3,0:07:20.25,0:07:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say it in your voice, so it should be fine.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:24.59,0:07:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:26.45,0:07:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My voice actress is excellent.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:30.77,0:07:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Voice actress?!
Dialogue: 3,0:07:32.03,0:07:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this, an anime?!
Dialogue: 3,0:07:34.64,0:07:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so beautiful, Hitagi-san.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:37.76,0:07:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The woman I've always dreamed of. I love you.
Dialogue: 3,0:07:42.10,0:07:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How was it? Pretty good?
Dialogue: 3,0:07:43.79,0:07:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close! I'd been looking forward to it, but it doesn't even match what I imagined!
Dialogue: 3,0:07:47.32,0:07:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even said anything like that yet!
Dialogue: 3,0:07:53.03,0:07:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yet". So you plan on it in the future?
Dialogue: 3,0:08:00.25,0:08:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 3,0:08:16.98,0:08:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hanekawa!
Dialogue: 3,0:08:23.09,0:08:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun!
Dialogue: 3,0:08:25.73,0:08:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to ride your bike in the park.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:29.00,0:08:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's parking for it.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:31.32,0:08:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to worry about that!
Dialogue: 3,0:08:34.07,0:08:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We're skipping school, quit worrying about biking.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:37.64,0:08:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They're completely different problems.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:40.07,0:08:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and stop.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:46.53,0:08:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you skip school, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:49.94,0:08:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:51.70,0:08:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I was angry? I wasn't trying to be sarcastic.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:55.41,0:08:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I planned it all out.
Dialogue: 3,0:08:59.25,0:09:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't have any trouble being absent from today's classes.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:05.91,0:09:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's going to happen to the preparations for the arts festival with the organizers gone?
Dialogue: 3,0:09:10.93,0:09:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having Senjougahara-san take care of things after school.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:15.49,0:09:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a mistake?
Dialogue: 3,0:09:17.46,0:09:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She took yesterday off.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:20.29,0:09:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's only fair.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:24.57,0:09:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,These have to be her pajamas.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:30.05,0:09:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hanekawa.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:31.74,0:09:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 3,0:09:32.95,0:09:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Hanekawa-sama.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:34.76,0:09:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sama?
Dialogue: 3,0:09:37.18,0:09:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take your shirt.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:41.94,0:09:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:43.95,0:09:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 3,0:09:46.15,0:09:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me angry.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:47.14,0:09:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:48.87,0:09:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm done joking around.
Dialogue: 3,0:09:51.85,0:09:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Hanekawa?
Dialogue: 3,0:09:53.90,0:09:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Those headaches again?
Dialogue: 3,0:09:58.07,0:10:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm feeling better now.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:04.58,0:10:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun... About Golden Week...
Dialogue: 3,0:10:09.24,0:10:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I remembered something.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:15.67,0:10:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not that.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:18.94,0:10:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm remembering something I forgot.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:23.04,0:10:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:24.92,0:10:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A cat.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:26.71,0:10:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a cat.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:31.68,0:10:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I remembered that.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:33.89,0:10:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The cat we buried together.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:38.52,0:10:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I remembered it.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:41.66,0:10:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But you didn't just call me out here because you remembered it.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:49.84,0:10:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:51.22,0:10:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,An aberration, huh...
Dialogue: 3,0:10:53.92,0:10:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 3,0:10:55.47,0:10:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'd like you to show me how to get to Oshino-san's place.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you show me the way?
Dialogue: 3,0:11:03.16,0:11:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:04.93,0:11:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,... Of course. But can I ask you a couple questions first?
Dialogue: 3,0:11:09.93,0:11:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess. Why?
Dialogue: 3,0:11:11.69,0:11:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been leaning too hard on Oshino to fix aberrations for me.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:15.45,0:11:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I end up making it his problem,
Dialogue: 3,0:11:17.93,0:11:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to have a handle on it first.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:20.55,0:11:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:21.83,0:11:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, go ahead and ask.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:24.67,0:11:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you've had lots of headaches lately. When exactly did they start?
Dialogue: 3,0:11:31.02,0:11:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Around a month ago.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:33.73,0:11:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday and the day before were both when I was with you,
Dialogue: 3,0:11:38.10,0:11:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've had them pretty bad at the bookstore and in front of school too.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:44.56,0:11:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have told me then!
Dialogue: 3,0:11:46.07,0:11:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to make you worry.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:51.03,0:11:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 3,0:11:53.08,0:11:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, after Golden Week,
Dialogue: 3,0:11:55.91,0:11:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,has anything happened to you involving cats?
Dialogue: 3,0:11:59.27,0:12:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Something involving cats?
Dialogue: 3,0:12:01.72,0:12:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Even just a black cat crossing your path.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:07.51,0:12:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,On May 27th,
Dialogue: 3,0:12:09.33,0:12:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the radio show I listen to at night read a letter from someone named "Big Bear Cat".
Dialogue: 3,0:12:16.12,0:12:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think that's related?
Dialogue: 3,0:12:19.54,0:12:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:21.34,0:12:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, this is what it said.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:24.61,0:12:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,People in comics and anime seem to have it really easy,
Dialogue: 3,0:12:28.63,0:12:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but being a maid must be incredibly stressful work.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:31.99,0:12:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't have any time to rest.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:34.52,0:12:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard this at a mixer recently, and it's right on the money.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:38.15,0:12:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to go into that much detail.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:40.61,0:12:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-kun. Don't you think there was something funny about that letter?
Dialogue: 3,0:12:45.40,0:12:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't quite put my finger on it, though.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:47.86,0:12:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... He heard that maids never have any spare time,
Dialogue: 3,0:12:52.94,0:12:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,from someone he met at a relaxed mixer.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:55.28,0:12:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:56.62,0:12:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you even need to tell me about that letter?!
Dialogue: 3,0:12:59.88,0:13:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. I didn't quite get it the first time.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:05.72,0:13:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, if you think hard about it, a "Big Bear Cat" isn't a cat, it's a panda!
Dialogue: 3,0:13:11.05,0:13:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:13.05,0:13:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 3,0:13:14.70,0:13:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 3,0:13:15.73,0:13:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... On the same show, there was a guy named "the Posturing Waggler".
Dialogue: 3,0:13:21.50,0:13:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"Lately, when I've played President with my friends,"
Dialogue: 3,0:13:26.50,0:13:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,"after someone deals, one of them keeps saying things."
Dialogue: 3,0:13:30.60,0:13:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Things like 'when I was in middle school, 4 was the highest card'."
Dialogue: 3,0:13:35.69,0:13:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's funny about this?
Dialogue: 3,0:13:37.29,0:13:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When I asked whether there was anything else, I didn't mean any more hard-to-understand letters.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:43.92,0:13:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, about that letter, in President there's all sorts of weird rules
Dialogue: 3,0:13:47.94,0:13:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,like "8s go out of turn" or "anyone who's no longer President becomes the Asshole".
Dialogue: 3,0:13:51.07,0:13:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The joke is that they pick the best rules for the hand they've drawn.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:56.32,0:13:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see! I knew you'd get it.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:00.06,0:14:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You thanking me for this doesn't make me happy.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:02.92,0:14:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, about the pen name "the Posturing Waggler",
Dialogue: 3,0:14:06.45,0:14:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"Posturing" and "Waggler" are written with the same kanji, so it's a bad pun.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:11.09,0:14:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But not all the letters to the show are that hard to understand.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:16.21,0:14:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone named "Walk toward the apple" wrote.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:18.83,0:14:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yesterday a friend and I went to a video rental place."
Dialogue: 3,0:14:23.06,0:14:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,"We wanted to rent the DVDs of a certain serial drama,"
Dialogue: 3,0:14:26.42,0:14:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"but someone else had volume 8 out,"
Dialogue: 3,0:14:30.75,0:14:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,"so we were only able to watch up to volume 7."
Dialogue: 3,0:14:33.85,0:14:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"My friend said 'volume 7 makes it seem like it ends in 8.'"
Dialogue: 3,0:14:39.09,0:14:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"'The person who has volume 8 out now must be chuckling.'"
Dialogue: 3,0:14:44.02,0:14:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"I think the person who rented volume 8 is playing Sevens."
Dialogue: 3,0:14:48.67,0:14:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty funny, but quit talking about the radio!
Dialogue: 3,0:14:52.64,0:14:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:54.30,0:14:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Next question, Hanekawa.
Dialogue: 3,0:14:59.08,0:15:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you take off your hat?
Dialogue: 3,0:15:03.02,0:15:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That...  That's not a question, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:07.85,0:15:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 3,0:15:08.97,0:15:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:10.55,0:15:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa-sama, let me take your hat.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:14.39,0:15:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:15.79,0:15:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 3,0:15:16.31,0:15:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me angry.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:18.46,0:15:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then be angry.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:21.19,0:15:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to be angry, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:24.07,0:15:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I care more about my debt to you than our friendship.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:30.51,0:15:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, your debt to me?
Dialogue: 3,0:15:34.08,0:15:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring break.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:36.48,0:15:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That... But that's...
Dialogue: 3,0:15:40.18,0:15:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you just save yourself?
Dialogue: 3,0:15:45.27,0:15:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:46.58,0:15:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oshino may say so,
Dialogue: 3,0:15:49.38,0:15:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think you saved me.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:52.38,0:15:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:55.57,0:15:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do something for you in return.
Dialogue: 3,0:15:57.77,0:16:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If I do, even if you get angry or hate me, I can take it.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:03.35,0:16:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it, huh.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:05.12,0:16:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty saucy.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:07.07,0:16:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 3,0:16:09.36,0:16:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming from you, it's saucy.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:13.21,0:16:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's something a bully would say.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:15.69,0:16:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to hear it from a star pupil.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:18.49,0:16:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:19.87,0:16:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:45.86,0:16:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done yet?
Dialogue: 3,0:16:48.46,0:16:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:50.58,0:16:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:51.94,0:16:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you thanking me?
Dialogue: 3,0:16:53.59,0:16:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... Okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:56.51,0:16:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like Golden Week again.
Dialogue: 3,0:16:59.68,0:17:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's that, we can deal with it.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:02.48,0:17:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:04.72,0:17:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:05.75,0:17:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to Oshino's.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:08.49,0:17:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're going to complain that doubling up on a bike is against the law?
Dialogue: 3,0:17:15.20,0:17:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of want to, but I'll let it slide.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:18.65,0:17:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I made you skip school, so it's fair.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:22.72,0:17:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't calling that a fair trade kind of weird?
Dialogue: 3,0:17:29.69,0:17:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, get on.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:33.68,0:17:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:39.46,0:17:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're soft.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:41.88,0:17:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And big!
Dialogue: 3,0:17:45.22,0:17:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:46.76,0:17:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something we need to talk about after we get off the bike.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:51.06,0:17:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get going.
Dialogue: 3,0:17:58.51,0:18:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Even still, it must be so much trouble for you.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:03.51,0:18:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to take care of so many people.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:07.25,0:18:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So many people?
Dialogue: 3,0:18:08.51,0:18:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Senjougahara-san, and Mayoi-chan, and Kanbaru-san,
Dialogue: 3,0:18:12.66,0:18:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and Sengoku-chan yesterday.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:15.82,0:18:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all girls, huh.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:17.36,0:18:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:18.96,0:18:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And always with aberrations, now that I think of it.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:24.99,0:18:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like you're not done yet.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:28.45,0:18:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:29.65,0:18:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Senjougahara-san really recovered that quickly.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:35.51,0:18:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It started when you were attacked by a vampire over spring break.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:41.63,0:18:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when it all began.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:44.61,0:18:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The aberrations themselves were always there.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:48.72,0:18:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like they just showed up one day.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:52.31,0:18:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 3,0:18:54.54,0:18:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what?
Dialogue: 3,0:18:56.56,0:18:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the special powers of vampires.
Dialogue: 3,0:18:59.72,0:19:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They captivate humans with their charm.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:04.07,0:19:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Captivate?
Dialogue: 3,0:19:04.87,0:19:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like hypnotism.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:07.64,0:19:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,One gaze into those eyes can captivate someone for life.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:12.92,0:19:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 3,0:19:14.85,0:19:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, just a thought I had.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:17.68,0:19:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it has something to do
Dialogue: 3,0:19:21.37,0:19:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,with why you're so popular with the girls all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:26.62,0:19:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm just teasing.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:31.09,0:19:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:34.11,0:19:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything, it helps me understand.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:36.22,0:19:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Charm, huh.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:38.45,0:19:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know everything.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:41.22,0:19:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know everything.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:44.34,0:19:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know everything.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:47.76,0:19:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything...
Dialogue: 3,0:19:54.88,0:19:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 3,0:19:57.82,0:20:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And the class prez, right?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:01.50,0:20:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Her hair's different, but with those glasses it's gotta be her.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:09.08,0:20:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Prez.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:10.92,0:20:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, I saw you yesterday.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:13.86,0:20:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What, can't you say "I've been waiting" or "I stayed up waiting"?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:18.28,0:20:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing like that today?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:20.80,0:20:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:26.24,0:20:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Prez?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:28.25,0:20:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You have today off?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:29.99,0:20:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really think he's trying to sabotage you.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:37.58,0:20:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's it?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:39.99,0:20:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be the Foundation Day I've heard about.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:42.56,0:20:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:46.62,0:20:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A cap?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:48.08,0:20:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That cap looks good on you.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:51.71,0:20:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 3,0:20:54.34,0:20:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what you're up to, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 3,0:20:57.05,0:21:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You really can't even take three steps without getting in trouble.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:02.24,0:21:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, come on in.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:04.71,0:21:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm really busy right now, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:10.09,0:21:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so busy I don't have any spare time.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:12.80,0:21:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:15.14,0:21:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:16.74,0:21:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're you, but I've gotta be a bit accomodating if Prez comes to me with a problem.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A meddlecat.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:27.18,0:21:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be considered one of the three legendary cat spirits.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:34.00,0:21:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're you, but I don't even need to tell this to Prez, do I?
Dialogue: 3,0:21:39.58,0:21:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it with the "You're you, but" when you mention Hanekawa.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:45.75,0:21:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting to get to me.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:47.95,0:21:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing it on purpose.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:51.58,0:21:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't tell a lie.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:54.58,0:21:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better keep your eyes open at night.
Dialogue: 3,0:21:56.97,0:21:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm a night owl.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:01.28,0:22:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cats are night owls, too.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:17.68,0:22:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa?!
Dialogue: 3,0:22:18.63,0:22:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get worked up, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:20.78,0:22:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite nice.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:22.21,0:22:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a good thing?
Dialogue: 3,0:22:24.35,0:22:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting to see Prez's cat ears,
Dialogue: 3,0:22:26.89,0:22:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,getting to see her in her pajamas,
Dialogue: 3,0:22:29.54,0:22:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't judge me like that!
Dialogue: 3,0:22:32.87,0:22:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 3,0:22:34.44,0:22:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a misunderstanding, is it?
Dialogue: 3,0:22:36.68,0:22:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything, you should thank me for giving you an excuse to bike the whole way here
Dialogue: 3,0:22:42.02,0:22:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,with Prez's arms wrapped around you.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:45.65,0:22:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already scouted out the situation, haven't you.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:50.02,0:22:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened with the shy girl the day before yesterday must have woken you up.
Dialogue: 3,0:22:55.36,0:22:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So Sengoku's a shy girl?
Dialogue: 3,0:22:57.82,0:23:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's happening?
Dialogue: 3,0:23:00.63,0:23:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,With what you've learned, I don't really have anything to do.
Dialogue: 3,0:23:05.69,0:23:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna skip a step here.
Dialogue: 3,0:23:07.95,0:23:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Skip a step?
Dialogue: 3,0:23:09.40,0:23:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time, right?
Dialogue: 3,0:23:12.00,0:23:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's quicker to ask her herself than bother Prez.
Dialogue: 3,0:23:18.89,0:23:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Herself?
Dialogue: 3,0:23:20.77,0:23:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 3,0:23:21.62,0:23:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 3,0:23:23.63,0:23:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Here she comes, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 3,0:23:25.69,0:23:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the sex kitten.
Dialogue: 3,0:23:40.05,0:23:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So we meet again, human. I'm amazed.
Dialogue: 3,0:23:43.22,0:23:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like you haven't been punished for lusting after my myaster's boobs.
Dialogue: 3,0:23:47.53,0:23:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always such a bad boy, meow.
Dialogue: 3,0:23:50.81,0:23:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be eaten up?
Dialogue: 3,0:25:25.54,0:25:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:26.05,0:25:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:26.84,0:25:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, about baseball.
Dialogue: 3,0:25:27.46,0:25:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,About baseball?
Dialogue: 3,0:25:28.18,0:25:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't question the ump, can you?
Dialogue: 3,0:25:29.87,0:25:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 3,0:25:30.54,0:25:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The ump's judgments are absolute!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:31.67,0:25:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The ump's judgments are absolute!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:33.27,0:25:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can try to fast-talk him.
Dialogue: 3,0:25:34.75,0:25:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Fast-talk him?
Dialogue: 3,0:25:35.53,0:25:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey umpire, don't pretend with me, you had to have seen that was an out.
Dialogue: 3,0:25:38.90,0:25:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it works!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:40.09,0:25:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Cunning!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:40.67,0:25:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do it at the wrong time, you get ejected!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:42.35,0:25:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Get outta here, you bum!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:43.05,0:25:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Preview quiz!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:44.02,0:25:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiz!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:44.44,0:25:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Preview squeeze!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:45.51,0:25:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Squeeze?
Dialogue: 3,0:25:45.92,0:25:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Squeeze means bunting!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:47.33,0:25:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunting?
Dialogue: 3,0:25:48.18,0:25:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a safety squeze? I don't get it!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:49.85,0:25:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it at all! What's safe about a sacrifice bunt?
Dialogue: 3,0:25:52.35,0:25:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sacrificial! That's a paradox, make up your mind!
Dialogue: 3,0:25:55.23,0:25:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Being so vague makes it confusing! What's with a bunt that makes you safe by sacrificing you?!
